52	        // Without this, Laravel's SortedMiddleware moves ThrottleRequests (priority 6)
53	        // ahead of SubstituteBindings (priority 9, injected by the `api` group), which
54	        // drags it ahead of every unlisted middleware between them — including the JWT
55	        // verifier. The per-uid rate limiters in AppServiceProvider then fire before
56	        // `supabase_uid` is set on the request and throw RuntimeException.
57	        $middleware->prependToPriorityList(
58	            \Illuminate\Routing\Middleware\ThrottleRequests::class,
